  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Cherry Blossom Empire, known among players as \"the weak princess game,\" is a game with the objective of keeping Princess Tatiana alive until her 18th birthday. That's easier said than done since Tatiana dies just from eating cake! So when an avid gamer who's finally cleared this frustrating game is reborn into it as Tatiana, she has to do it all over again, starting as a baby... But with a potential death ending lurking at every corner, will Tatiana's gaming skills be enough for her to survive?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
